  "description": "After quitting her high-pressure job, Seo-Ri returns home and reluctantly joins swimming lessons at her brother’s urging. There, she meets instructor Yu-Jeong — her brother’s friend, who instantly recognizes her as his first love. Under summer’s heat and rain, a heart-fluttering romance begins.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
